\title{mlAEWMA: Machine Learning Based Adaptive EWMA Control Charts for Dispersion}
\description{
Adaptive EWMA control charts for the variance of a process whose smoothing
weight is predicted by a fitted regression model. Nine models in four
families are provided: neural networks (\code{\link[=mlaewma_neural]{mlaewma_neural()}}), support vector
machines (\code{\link[=mlaewma_svm]{mlaewma_svm()}}), trees and boosting (\code{\link[=mlaewma_tree]{mlaewma_tree()}}) and dynamic
quantile regression (\code{\link[=mlaewma_dqr]{mlaewma_dqr()}}). \code{\link[=mlaewma_compare]{mlaewma_compare()}} runs all nine and
\code{\link[=calculate_arl]{calculate_arl()}} estimates run lengths by simulation.
}
